// IntroString :
"P480153541" "I'll make no bones about it, {VillainName}: I don't trust you. Not yet. You'll have to prove yourself to me before that can happen. Luckily, I've got a way for you to do just that. There's a certain young lady in Nerva who seems to be making a name for herself as a hero. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to take her out.</A>"
