"P842333723" "Whew. Well, that's a load off my mind. Operative Vargas will have to do some fast maneuvering to prove that he's not responsible for that embezzlement. And I'm in the clear, for now at least. It's a tricky web we walk, {VillainName}, those of us who choose to serve Arachnos. For a while, the living is sweet. But there comes a time for almost all of us when our welcome has worn out, and we must pay for our sins. When your time comes, {VillainName}, make sure you know about it in advance."
// RandomFameString :
"P1440144582" "I heard Operative Rutger was on his way out, but somehow he's still around!"

